    "title": "Starke County Republican Party to hold caucus to fill Starke County Recorder vacancy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Becca Shepherd ,\n1 days ago The Starke County Republican Party has announced the call of a Political Party Caucus to fill the remaining term of Starke County Recorder. In an online announcement made on Friday, the Starke County Republican Party expressed gratitude to resigning Starke County Recorder Mandy Thomason for her years of service as the Starke County Recorder. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
